9221056,2024-06-10,Debt collection,I do not know,Written notification about debt,Didn't receive notice of right to dispute,"Alleged Violation of 15 USC 1692g - Validation of Debt I am asserting that a debt collection attempt made by Systems & Services Technologies , Inc., breaches my rights under the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ), particularly under 15 USC 1692g, which mandates the validation of debt.

